{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0823427a0195b6291f2916786e23386a1371ca152d57341537cf0a243d42aa05", "ja": "（BOTと『好奇心∞無限大！』の連動企画、\n3人とも熱心に取り組んでくれている）", "zh": "（与BOT和“好奇心∞无穷大！”的联动企划，3人也都在认真参与）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1001_p", "source_sha256": "270a4e60bfb81829425115a942b195f38c241a28676968534c4ad8652bd3d42c", "ja": "（これは盛り上がりが期待できそうだな。\n……ん？）", "zh": "（感觉这次活动会很热闹啊。……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "492f51b913bbbfefafa1170346d737f3c554bdb6c0f82a0db34bdd3a7c6e972f", "ja": "ふんふんふ～～ん♪　意外といろいろ知らないな～♪\nせっかくだから、知りたいな～♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～～♪　没想到还有好多事情都不知道呢～♪\n难得有这个机会，我想了解一下～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1003_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "31d34e1464732f6f925c585d9efad8f03aeaa171d24e78fd737e6165a18e2fe1", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d8ed5b8872eb5742b7c62005942c4fdd5abc81041ce12016fe37dab770111136", "ja": "やっぱり可奈だったか。\nお疲れ様、早いんだな。", "zh": "果然是可奈啊。\n辛苦了，来得挺早呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b2262270fa1b744df2a2bb3ac053269b16b62f7e2fce4077a2ff6f67ddf7ce00", "ja": "プレゼンの準備か？　精が出るな！\nあれ？　そのガイドブック、横浜じゃない……？", "zh": "是在准备演示吗？真勤奋啊！\n咦？那本旅游指南，不是横滨的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "49636e398494e7f01a823224502a400a3bc097e95cb1f901ebe589a92e5f6c0a", "ja": "あっ、そうなんです。えへへ……。", "zh": "啊，对的。嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "0bdb4268abc863ca10bc8c15f558414b426ff5fbe695d223661e36693865ce50", "ja": "今回のお仕事で地元についていろいろ調べてたら、\n地元なのに、知らないことがたくさんあって。", "zh": "这次为了工作查了很多关于家乡的资料，才发现明明是自己的家乡，却还有好多不了解的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "918a54841931a9e75ba3603647d3df466e3c167199cc260107cd6127ce5e3264", "ja": "そういえば、劇場のあるこの辺りのことも、\nちっとも知らないなぁって。", "zh": "说起来，剧场所在的这一带，我也完全不了解呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "e7ed9c740f800da9eba2475147b9a3ba71d2b1cdc9e617a3c62534d2e66ac7da", "ja": "それでガイドブックを借りてきたんですけど、\nちょっぴり、楽しくなってきちゃって……。", "zh": "所以我就借了本旅游指南回来，\n不知不觉有点期待起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1d09a506c17138990d5f04582ef8484b3be05ecd330d53951cd5f3b487b9d369", "ja": "なるほど。見てもいいか？", "zh": "原来如此。可以让我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "126fa63a66a38c15281bf67d15071d279feaefc9c93e05c67931dd9a72272bde", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！　ちゃんとしてないけど、\n{$P$}さんには、見てほしいな～♪", "zh": "好的，当然可以！虽然还没准备好，\n但我还是想让{$P$}先生看看～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1013_p", "source_sha256": "66e2f925071b106a68919655d81636cf6f10b592f93c2a0cbc8f867790be1e74", "ja": "……これは、なかなかいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "……这感觉相当不错啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "c4e6b6a4966fac5f6939e9cddb383b83c9dbc5bcbb3c4863ea6cebc9023a1260", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？", "zh": "咦，真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d45fe586bff519db632115aa97e4ee11f0c493de1323d6a64ecb40d3c4c6d2f2", "ja": "水上バスツアーに、伝統芸能の鑑賞、下町散策……\nうん、どれも面白そうだ。", "zh": "水上巴士之旅、欣赏传统艺术、逛逛老街……\n嗯，感觉每个都挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8962e28fcf903f2abc49fa390204bd4be2c8e60ac0b55727500ad8f38099a789", "ja": "考えてみれば、地元って案外知らないものだよな。\nそれに、劇場には遠征で来てくれるお客さんも多いし。", "zh": "这么一想，原来我们对自己的家乡还意外地不太了解呢。\n而且，还有很多观众会专程来到剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c54c4c4984c9e606ce8a3814626ec995bce4c0520a23783a821c731a74cc21ef", "ja": "こういう劇場周辺ガイドみたいなものがあったら、\n喜んでもらえると思う！", "zh": "如果有这种剧场周边指南之类的东西，大家应该会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1018_p", "source_sha256": "68f936977c722f7b6000a2e9a9257dae86d0cf55e038ebd76baede04ef98f305", "ja": "可奈さえよければ、試しに作ってみないか？\nもちろん、誰かに手伝ってもらってもいいし。", "zh": "只要可奈愿意，要不要试着做一个？\n当然，也可以请别人帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "2f6f838621ca830417ebf5d87fb3a25be4822aab0f13e91e46133869435f4619", "ja": "ええっ、本当ですか！？\n私、やってみたいです！", "zh": "诶诶，真的吗！？\n我想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c06cba0e83d7fd75e32de040e53865bc847f25a6b0a3be8ef0edf3953a84bdab", "ja": "ああ。当日は番組用のプレゼンがあるから、\n無理はしないでほしいけどな！", "zh": "是的。当天还要进行节目用的演示，所以我不希望你太勉强自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "c3e50ff4f3e4084bd98518cef8117d91d7e589c1af1a138a48716c41d7fa0194", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！\n私の地元の魅力も、みんなに知ってほしいし……。", "zh": "好的，当然可以！\n我也想让大家了解我的家乡魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "f05da59c363beaed09926db55856749b79f9f0312dd023190d489b7c66cf6ff0", "ja": "わ～、なんだかやる気が出てきちゃったな～！\n行くぞ横浜、異国情緒が待ってるぞ～♪", "zh": "哇～总觉得干劲一下子就上来了呢～！\n出发去横滨，异国风情在等着我们哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9ded651cf46fb10ef3cb4826f809a7100d475639543d6751d699d8037f28823b", "ja": "（仕事を通して、興味や関心が広がっていく……\nきっと番組を見た人も、同じように感じるだろう）", "zh": "（通过工作，兴趣和关注的领域也在不断扩大……看过节目的观众一定也会有同样的感受吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0603_1024_p", "source_sha256": "72b18fc8fce9106e52163f6551f42c6542a123c919d88cf03561666004d70920", "ja": "（自主的な学びは、きっと\n可奈を大きく成長させてくれるはずだ）", "zh": "（自主学习一定会让可奈得到很大的成长吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
